### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8084
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Login as Admin (Returns JWT with ROLE_ADMIN)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Store Token
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### 2. Login as Cashier (Returns JWT with ROLE_CASHIER)
# @name cashierLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "cashier",
  "password": "cashier123"
}

### Store Cashier Token
@cashierToken = {{cashierLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### 3. Validate Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Test Invalid Credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### =======================================================
### Testing through API Gateway (Port 8080)
### =======================================================

### 5. Login via Gateway
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 6. Access Catalog (Protected by Gateway JWT validation)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/catalog/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Access Catalog WITHOUT Token (Must return 401 UNAUTHORIZED)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/catalog/products
Accept: application/json
